>        If so, then my lengthy AC analysis is incomplete.

Then I'm afraid it's incomplete. :)  The value used for calculating
to-hit is AC_VALUE(u.uac), which uses your plain AC if AC>=0, or a
random number between -1 and your AC if AC<0.  10 is added to that, then
various mods for invisibility, negative multi, etc...  Finally, if
that's greater than rnd(20+i), the monster hits and the code moves into
hitmu().  

